NOTE ON DATA

This licence covers the SOURCE CODE in this repository only.

It does not cover the HAM10000 dataset, which is distributed separately by
its authors under CC BY-NC terms and is not redistributed here -- including
the 490 seed images. Two HAM10000-derived label tables ARE included and
remain under the dataset's own licence; see NOTICE.txt for the full
carve-out, and HOW_TO_RUN.txt for how to obtain the images and the checksums
that verify you have the same copy used in these experiments.

    Tschandl, P., Rosendahl, C. & Kittler, H. The HAM10000 dataset, a large
    collection of multi-source dermatoscopic images of common pigmented skin
    lesions. Sci. Data 5, 180161 (2018).
